  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7afb57b0cdf24255",
      "translationZh": "Observer 是一个免费的开源智能体，使用小型本地 LLM 来监控你的屏幕，让你不必亲自盯着。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "298134a7cadeec11",
      "translationZh": "我刚发布了 Observer v3.0.0，其中包含一个用于控制微智能体框架的新智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "640a7227b5b9be01",
      "translationZh": "你只需输入以下内容，就能设置微智能体工作流：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50c75a3c64f63fc1",
      "translationZh": "“每 10 分钟向我发送一次这个仪表盘的状态，但如果出了问题，就给我打电话。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9de591ac29e7419",
      "translationZh": "“监控我的屏幕和摄像头，记录分心模式，每 24h 向我发送一份报告。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4578cda17bfc8a03",
      "translationZh": "“当我的 Steam 游戏下载完成时，给我打电话。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3e578e7da3e9d75",
      "translationZh": "“如果我的 Github 工作流需要批准，就给我发一条 WhatsApp 消息。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7152e18d2dd0db52",
      "translationZh": "“当 Claude Cowork 完成时，给我打电话。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3ac9792065498c6",
      "translationZh": "全都运行本地 LLM！（甚至可以在浏览器里运行）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e23059aec14122a8",
      "translationZh": "完全免费。而且开源 :DD",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4f60f261d11c512",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 r/ObserverAI 分享你那些超酷的 Micro-Agent 点子！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbd16cbc557b80b4",
      "translationZh": "试试这个网页应用：https://app.observer-ai.com",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177a8468a5c0242a",
      "translationZh": "Github（自由开源软件！）：https://github.com/Roy3838/Observer",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e75d48878848d7e",
      "translationZh": "大家如果有任何问题或建议，请告诉我 c:",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "662be73e65e7a2f8",
      "translationZh": "我会在评论区待着，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "987dc7d2da422099",
      "translationZh": "PS：这次用了更短的句子，加入了更多使用场景，重新发了一遍，因为之前的帖子听起来像 LLM 写的，被删了 😅 我最近花了很多时间用 Claude Code :p",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
